p array and the house, placed in the middle and lower portion of the frame. Exclusions: no text, no captions, no logos, no visible brand names, no signage, no screens, no people looking at the camera, no stock-photo poses, no clutter on the roof, no fake certifications or badges, no extra decorative objects in the foreground.","textPlacement":"top"},"supportingText":"Free site survey for your rooftop","sourceQuotes":["Potential to cut electricity bills by up to 98%","Free site survey","Assistance with PM Surya Ghar subsidy and net metering","Local solar teams in Mohali and Hisar"]}
